amage (@Check[reflex|dc:37|basic|options:area-effect] save)</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":5,"traits":["fire","primal"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["aura","fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.SqfVOvexkATbeU7x"},{"_id":"FvCzcBVRvmZ11mTe","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","sort":1000000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>90 feet. @Check[will|dc:39|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened]</p><hr /><p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":90,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":{"value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.FvCzcBVRvmZ11mTe"},{"_id":"QWxMF0tTh2JjNiIy","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike (Jaws only)","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core"},"rules":[],"slug":"reactive-strike","traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.QWxMF0tTh2JjNiIy"},{"_id":"qg1YTpzUg6KvMuWQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"All Becomes Flame","sort":1200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon curses a creature within 60 feet to have its magic replaced with primordial flames. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:39] save. Regardless of the result, the target becomes temporarily immune for 1 day.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is cursed for 1 round. While cursed, any damage the cursed creature would deal by any means becomes fire damage, regardless of the original damage type. The cursed creature can temporarily suppress the curse for 1 round as an action.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the curse's duration is 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As success, but the curse's duration is 1 day.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["curse","fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.qg1YTpzUg6KvMuWQ"},{"_id":"jJAaOJxctRpOQvaI","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Draconic Frenzy","sort":1300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon makes two claw Strikes and one wing Strike in any order.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.jJAaOJxctRpOQvaI"},{"_id":"ZxIcKCg8VlLaYO7J","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Draconic Momentum","sort":1400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon recharges their Pyre Breath whenever they score a critical hit with a Strike.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"strike-attack-roll","text":"{item|description}","title":"{item|name}","visibility":"owner"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.ZxIcKCg8VlLaYO7J"},{"_id":"NEGCX9pCG8gyZcjL","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Pyre Breath","sort":1500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon breathes a blast of flame that deals @Damage[18d6[fire]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[type:cone|distance:60] (@Check[reflex|dc:41|basic|options:area-effect] save). Creatures that critically fail their save catch fire, taking @Damage[2d6[persistent,fire]] damage. The area then fills with black smoke for 1 minute. This has the effects of mist, except it fills the cone's area. The dragon can't use Pyre Breath again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Pyre Breath]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.NEGCX9pCG8gyZcjL"},{"_id":"jmrC9phVteComdYb","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Stoke the Flames","sort":1600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The dragon intensifies nearby fires. Every foe within 60 feet that is taking persistent fire damage takes @Damage[5d6[fire]] damage.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["fire","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!BgfI9KD0dTiFojO4.jmrC9phVteComdYb"}],"name":"Cinder Dragon (Ancient)","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":7},"con":{"mod":8},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":5},"str":{"mod":10},"wis":{"mod":6}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":42},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":425,"temp":0,"value":425},"immunities":[{"type":"fire"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"sleep"}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":180}],"value":60},"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold","value":20}]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":["common","draconic","pyric"]},"level":{"value":19},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Among the largest and fiercest dragons, cinder dragons are typically volatile, demanding respect—even deference—from lesser creatures. Cinder dragons' appearance evokes their flame, often in scales with mixed patterns of red, orange, and yellow. Many cinder dragons dwell in active volcanoes and similarly fiery locales. Cinder dragons prefer treasures that can withstand the heat of their bodies and lairs, with gemstones, gold, and silver common among their hoards.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core 2"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"smoke vision","mod":35,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"},{"acuity":"imprecise","range":60,"type":"scent"}]},"resources":{},"saves"